  <diagram id="kernel-v3-domain-classes" name="04 C4建模架构图">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2350" dy="1114" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="0" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0-4" />
        <mxCell id="1-4" parent="0-4" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam componentStyle uml2\nskinparam defaultFontName sans-serif\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8F9FA\nskinparam roundcorner 10\n\ntitle 生产级 Agent OS 核心模块架构图 (组件图)\n\n&#39; 客户端接入层\nnode \&quot;Client Interface\&quot; {\n    [Web UI / API Gateway] as Gateway\n}\n\n&#39; L1: 统一控制平面 (最核心的业务串联层)\npackage \&quot;L1: 统一控制层 (Control &amp; Orchestration Runtime)\&quot; #EAF2F8 {\n    [会话管理器 (Session Manager)] as SessionMgr\n    [上下文组装器 (Context Manager)] as ContextMgr\n    [统一调度与工作流引擎 (Workflow Engine)] as Scheduler\n    [拦截器 / PEP (Policy Enforcement Point)] as PEP\n    \n    database \&quot;聚合根持久化 (State DB)\&quot; as DB {\n        folder \&quot;Sessions\&quot;\n        folder \&quot;Memory\&quot;\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; L2: 认知引擎层\npackage \&quot;L2: 认知引擎层 (Cognitive Runtime)\&quot; #FEF9E7 {\n    [Agent 核心 (Agent Loop)] as AgentCore\n    [格式解析与纠错 (Parser)] as Parser\n    cloud \&quot;LLM API (GPT-4 / Qwen)\&quot; as LLM\n}\n\n&#39; 安全控制平面\npackage \&quot;Security Plane\&quot; #FDEDEC {\n    [鉴权中心 / PDP (Policy Decision Point)] as PDP\n    database \&quot;权限规则库 (RBAC/ABAC)\&quot; as PolicyDB\n}\n\n&#39; L3/L4: 物理执行层\npackage \&quot;L3/L4: 受控与沙盒执行层 (Execution Runtime)\&quot; #E9F7EF {\n    [工具路由网关 (Tool Router)] as ToolRouter\n    [L3: 内部业务 API (微服务)] as InternalAPI\n    node \&quot;L4: 微隔离沙盒 (MicroVM/Docker)\&quot; as Sandbox {\n        [Code Interpreter]\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; === 定义业务逻辑调用链路与依赖关系 ===\n\n&#39; 1. 外部请求接入\nGateway --&gt; Scheduler : 1. 发起任务请求 (携带租户/User Token)\n\n&#39; 2. 状态装载\nScheduler --&gt; SessionMgr : 2. 唤醒/创建 Session\nSessionMgr --&gt; DB : 读写持久化状态\nSessionMgr --&gt; ContextMgr : 3. 提取 Memory 与动态上下文 (RAG)\n\n&#39; 3. 认知流转\nScheduler --&gt; AgentCore : 4. 注入 Context 并启动 AgentRun\nAgentCore &lt;--&gt; LLM : 思考与推理\nAgentCore --&gt; Parser : 解析意图 (生成 ToolRequest)\nParser --&gt; Scheduler : 5. 抛出动作请求回主控层\n\n&#39; 4. 安全拦截与审批\nScheduler --&gt; PEP : 6. 拦截动作，发起鉴权\nPEP --&gt; PDP : 7. 携带 Context 询问权限\nPDP --&gt; PolicyDB : 查算策略\nPDP -.-&gt; PEP : 8. 返回鉴权结果 (通过/挂起审批)\n\n&#39; 5. 工具执行\nPEP --&gt; ToolRouter : 9. 鉴权通过，下发放行凭证\nToolRouter --&gt; InternalAPI : 确定性动作 (查库/发邮件)\nToolRouter --&gt; Sandbox : 非确定性动作 (执行 Python 脚本)\n\n&#39; 数据回流\nToolRouter -.-&gt; Scheduler : 10. 返回执行结果写入黑板\nScheduler -.-&gt; SessionMgr : 11. Loop 结束，Commit 状态入库\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="shljIDy1qJwBftTrzA7N-0">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1-4" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1090.0004208416835" width="2650" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="shljIDy1qJwBftTrzA7N-91" connectable="0" parent="shljIDy1qJwBftTrzA7N-0" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
